msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum "
"algorithms skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Ambil peperiksaan 20 soalan di laman IBM Training untuk menguji kemahiran "
"algoritma kuantum anda dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

